LocateAnything port for GPT-QModel
==================================

The Python modules in this directory are an independent implementation written by
ModelCloud.ai under the Apache License 2.0. They were written in a clean-room process
from a behavioral specification (configuration fields, tensor names and shapes, and the
observable numerical behavior of the model), not from the original source code.

The implementation is compatible with the format of the published NVIDIA
LocateAnything checkpoints (for example nvidia/LocateAnything-3B): it reads the same
config.json fields and state-dict keys. Model weights are not part of this repository and
remain under the terms their publisher distributes them with.

The Qwen2/Qwen3 decoder building blocks are imported from GPT-QModel's vendored
Apache-2.0 Transformers 5.23 families in ../native/qwen2 and ../native/qwen3.
